<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 334,850 more shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 334,850 more shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it bought back a further 334,850 shares on Monday between NZ$6.34 and $6.41 as part of its continuing $1 billion share buyback.</p>
<p>The shares closed at $6.43, up 14 cents.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
